{"id":"n14106-1-6","stage":3,"title":"실장 · 室长","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14106-1-6-1","ko":"홍보실 실장이 바뀐다는 소문이 있던데요.","zh":"听说宣传部的部长要换人了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"홍보실","meaning":"宣传部门","explanation":"홍보실：宣传部门。","readings":[{"term":"홍보실","audio":"/audio/2cf552a2bfab8186a1ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:홍보실:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"홍보실","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"홍보실","audio":"/audio/2cf552a2bfab8186a1ce.mp3"}},{"text":"실장이","meaning":"室长，办公室主任","explanation":"실장：室长，办公室主任；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"실장","audio":"/audio/d35e6c026303320863a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14106","senseId":"1","lemma":"실장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실장이","audio":"/audio/8039a75d91b35c0c9dff.mp3"}},{"text":"바뀐다는","meaning":"改变，转变，更改","explanation":"바뀌다：改变，转变，更改；ㄴ다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"바뀌다","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61179","senseId":"3","lemma":"바뀌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바뀐다는","audio":"/audio/0f96b76645502330a0ca.mp3"}},{"text":"소문이","meaning":"传闻，传言","explanation":"소문：传闻，传言；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소문","audio":"/audio/69d345cbab4729f2caec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83167","senseId":"1","lemma":"소문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소문이","audio":"/audio/7ed6c8cfd2042b9cd623.mp3"}},{"text":"있던데요.","meaning":"有、存在（有传闻）","explanation":"있다：有、存在（有传闻）；던데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있던데요","audio":"/audio/63d618311e278aa3b24a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2cf552a2bfab8186","term":"홍보실","zh":"宣传部门","audio":"/audio/2cf552a2bfab8186a1ce.mp3","definition":"承担宣传、公共关系工作的部门。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d35e6c0263033208","term":"실장","zh":"室长，办公室主任","audio":"/audio/d35e6c026303320863a6.mp3","entryId":"14106","definition":"政府、机关或公司里带“室”字的一定部门的负责人。","pronunciation":["실짱"]},{"id":"5207e639323d4244","term":"바뀌다","zh":"改变，转变，更改","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3","entryId":"61179","definition":"内容或状态等变化或变样。","pronunciation":["바뀌다"]},{"id":"69d345cbab4729f2","term":"소문","zh":"传闻，传言","audio":"/audio/69d345cbab4729f2caec.mp3","entryId":"83167","definition":"在众人之间广泛传播的话语或消息。","pronunciation":["소ː문"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有、存在（有传闻）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"有、存在（有传闻）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/77f6d27ad664d3c6b81b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14106-1-6-2","ko":"그럼 지금 계신 실장님은 그만두시는 건가요?","zh":"那么现在在位的部长要辞职吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"계신","meaning":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈身居某个地位或职位。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)身份高的人或长辈身居某个地位或职位；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17749","senseId":"3","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계신","audio":"/audio/4ab47670c47861ce977a.mp3"}},{"text":"실장님은","meaning":"室长，办公室主任","explanation":"실장：室长，办公室主任；님：尊称后缀；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"실장","audio":"/audio/d35e6c026303320863a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14106","se